    "diskman can move %@ of caches and logs to the Trash." : {},
    "diskman reads names and sizes in the places below, and the contents of two kinds of file: each app's Info.plist and signature, and the background-job files in LaunchAgents and LaunchDaemons. It never opens your documents, and it removes nothing until you press the button; then it only moves items to the Trash." : {},
