    "Lets diskman find leftovers in protected folders. Everything you remove still only goes to the Trash." : {},
    "Logs" : {},
    "macOS hides other apps' containers and a few Library folders from every app. With access diskman can see leftovers there; without it, it works with what it can see. To check whether access is granted, it tries to open one of these:" : {},
    "Measures the caches and logs that are safe to remove. Nothing is removed." : {},
